Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on August 18, 2012; provided, the amended provisions of Articles 16-2 and 16-3 shall enter into force on February 18, 2013.
Article 2 (Special cases concerning culture and arts education organizations)
A culture and arts education organization that, as at the time this Decree enters into force, has employed only professional personnel for arts and culture education under the previous provisions shall, within 3 years from the enforcement of this Decree, employ either a teacher or at least 1 full-time arts and culture education instructor pursuant to the amended provisions of Article 2 (2) 2.
Article 3 (Special cases concerning regional culture and arts education support centers)
A regional culture and arts education support center designated under the previous provisions as at the time this Decree enters into force shall, within 3 years from the enforcement of this Decree, employ at least 1 full-time arts and culture education instructor pursuant to the amended provisions of Article 9 (1) 3.
Article 4 (Transitional measures concerning completion of arts and culture education curricula)
Where the content of a curriculum completed prior to the enforcement of this Decree under the previous version of the Appendix is recognized as identical to a subject under the amended provisions of Appendix 2, such subject shall be deemed to have been completed under Appendix 2 as amended.

