Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on March 1, 2016; provided, the amended provisions of subparagraph 2 of Article 22 and Note 3 of Appendix 1 shall enter into force on the date of promulgation.
Article 2 (Transitional measures concerning completion of educational curricula for arts and culture education instructors)
(1) A person who, as at the time this Decree enters into force, has graduated from or is enrolled in a university, industrial university, junior college, technical college, or miscellaneous school under subparagraphs 1, 2, 4, 6, and 7 of Article 2 of the Higher Education Act, a graduate school under Article 29 of that Act, or a college related to culture and the arts established under any Act other than the Higher Education Act, or who has completed or is completing a curriculum at an educational institution for arts and culture education instructors, may obtain the qualification of a Grade 2 arts and culture education instructor under the main clause of Article 27-2 (1) of the Act, if he or she satisfies the curriculum requirements under the previous provisions of subparagraph 2 of Appendix 2 or the amended provisions of that subparagraph by March 31, 2021, as prescribed in subparagraph 2 of Appendix 1.
(2) Where a person intends to obtain the qualification of an arts and culture education instructor based on the curriculum requirements under the amended provisions of subparagraph 2 Appendix 2 pursuant to paragraph (1), if the subject of the curriculum completed under the previous provisions of subparagraph 2 of Appendix 2 prior to the enforcement of this Decree is recognized by the Minister of Culture, Sports and Tourism as identical to those under the amended provisions of that subparagraph, such subject shall be deemed to have been completed under the amended provisions of subparagraph 2 of Appendix 2.

